    "1657348293dc4e4fd8": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "165734829349367447-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Anja Booth: Your Space for Focus"
          }
        },
        "165734829349367447-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Anja is a self-contained acoustic booth for open-plan spaces. Step inside and shut out the noise: the wraparound form and acoustic panels create a calm setting for focused work, private calls and quick catch-ups, all without permanent walls. With soundproofing of up to 30 dB, a private conversation stays private and the surrounding office stays outside.<br/><br/>The booth is made from high-performance recycled PET, with an aluminium frame, tempered glass and recycled PET acoustic panels inside and out. The result is a tactile, contemporary finish that lifts an interior rather than cluttering it, and a build that is durable and light enough to move as your space evolves.<br/><br/>Everything needed is built in: an integrated ventilation system, adjustable light control and integrated power, all plug and play, so the booth is ready to use the moment it arrives. Anja comes in two sizes, a single-person booth with a fixed-height desk and a two-person booth for collaborative work, and it relocates easily when the layout changes.<br/><br/>It is a fast, low-cost way to add quiet, enclosed space wherever it is needed, from open-plan offices and co-working hubs to education, healthcare and public settings. Set against conventional construction, Anja is a competitively priced, relocatable alternative that you can move and reuse rather than demolish.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
