        },
        "features_list_right_hMY3H8": {
          "type": "features_list_right",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Pod Placement",
            "description": "<p>The placement of an acoustic pod can make a big difference to how well it performs. In spaces with high ceilings and large windows, positioning pods near a wall helps reduce echo.</p><p>It’s also important to leave enough space around the pod for proper airflow, and adding soft furnishings or plants nearby can further improve acoustics.</p><p>If you’re unsure where to place your pod, feel free to get in touch—our team will be happy to help you find the best spot.</p>"
