        "image_position": "right",
        "mobile_image_position": "top",
        "title": "Lighting and Ventilation",
        "detection": "<p>The overhead comforts carry over: a ceiling light you can dim to suit the meeting, and a built-in ventilation fan that keeps two people comfortable through a longer session.<br/></p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": ""
      }
    },
    "703a9024-9f53-4f02-bab2-e969aab39065": {
