        "image_position": "left",
        "mobile_image_position": "top",
        "title": "Modern Applications",
        "detection": "<p>Inside sits a work table with integrated power, so a laptop and phone charge at the desk without leads trailing across the room. The tempered glass door and aluminium alloy handle open onto a space you complete with your own chair. It runs from a single plug, with nothing to wire in and nothing to build, and it can be repositioned when the floor plan changes.<br/></p>",
